t of borrowing rose slightly to 7.76% from 7.72% in the prior quarter.","quote":"The cost of borrowing for the quarter stood at 7.76% versus 7.72% in the previous quarter.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects cross-selling to expand quarter-on-quarter and provide a fundamental boost to operating leverage.","quote":"That also gives us both the gross sale piece from year on, which is started in a small way, but probably quarter on quarter will keep expanding. It's going to be one fundamental booster for your operating leverage.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management sees scope for continued strength and improvement in credit costs over the next one to two years.","quote":"On the credit cost itself, I think we have a fair sense of scope for further moving strength to strength over the next one year to two years.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company plans to add approximately 400 new gold loan branches during the current financial year.","quote":"We remain on track to add a total of approximately 400 new branches in this financial year.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Portfolio yield improved by roughly 45 basis points sequentially to reach 14.08%.","quote":"our portfolio yield has increased by approximately 45 basis points over quarter one. So it's now at 14.08%, demonstrating effective transmission of previous disbursement yield onto the portfolio yield.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POON