emented.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company introduced an AI voice bot dialer capable of conducting natural conversations with internal and external stakeholders.","quote":"A new advancement this quarter is our voice bot dialer, which reaches out to and holds a natural conversation stakeholders at scale, internal or external.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Management highlighted risks including earnings fluctuations, growth management challenges, competition, economic conditions, and changing regulations.","quote":"Risks and uncertainties related to these statements include fluctuations in earnings, our ability to manage growth, competition, economic conditions in India and abroad, changes in law, rules, and regulations, relating to any aspect of the company's business operations","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"With our latest origination cohorts demonstrating superior 6 MOB performance, we are truly moving from strength to strength, and our confidence in the resilience and quality of this portfolio is on a high.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/POONAWALLA.NS/earnings?eventId=709994","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Profit after tax increased by 21.8% quarter-on-quarter to 375 crore rupees in Q2FY27.","quote":"PAT increased 21.8% QoQ to ₹375 Cr in Q2FY27 from ₹308 Cr in Q1FY27","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POONAWALLA_09102026163102_PFLInvestorPresentation09102026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Pre-provision operating profit grew by 11.8% sequentially, reflecting operating leverage and disciplined execution.","quote":"PPOP expanded by 11.8% QoQ highlighting strong operating leverage and disciplined execution","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POONAWALLA_09102026163102_PFLInvestorPresentation09102026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Asset quality improved as Gross NPA dropped by 17 basis points quarter-on-quarter and 39 basis points year-on-year without accelerated write-offs.","quote":"Improved asset quality with reduction in Gross NPA of 17 bps QoQ & 39 bps YoY. No accelerated write-off during the quarter","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POONAWALLA_09102026163102_PFLInvestorPresentation09102026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company targets growing assets under management at an annual compound rate of 35% to 40% over the next couple of years.","quote":"We seek to continue growing our AUM at ~35- 40% CAGR over the next couple of years","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POONAWALLA_09102026163102_PFLInvestorPresentation09102026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management plans to build a large consumer franchise and expand priority businesses including consumer durables, gold loans, and digital business loans.","quote":"Build an at-scale consumer franchise with superior engagement and retention Scale priority businesses: >2x Consumer Durables franchise, Gold Loan network expansion and digital Business Loans","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POONAWALLA_09102026163102_PFLInvestorPresentation09102026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Total borrowings stood at 58,865 crore rupees alongside total liquidity of 6,526 crore rupees as of September 30, 2026.","quote":